-## Included in 0.1
+## Included in 0.2
 
 - Android TV / Google TV launcher entry and Player Pop compatibility
-- premium dark home with hero, catalog rails and visible D-pad focus
+- premium dark home with hero, compact category filters and visible D-pad focus
 - Live, Movies and Series catalog navigation
 - Continue Watching and local, private recommendations
 - New Episodes button, unread badge and an expandable notification drawer
-- automatic catalog refresh baseline (at most once every six hours)
+- streaming catalogue ingestion in 250-row chunks to cap peak RAM usage
+- bounded home shelves and paged category queries; the full catalogue is never copied into TV memory
