 - accent-insensitive title, actor and director search when metadata is available
 - remote microphone search with French/English auto-switch on Android 14+
 - French and English TV labels
-- parallel catalog synchronization for shorter refreshes
+- stability-first MPV buffering plus automatic live-stream reconnects
 - safer resumable downloads and redacted IPTV credentials in logs
 
